Why? {ki'u ma}
How? {ta'i ma}
Favorite Question? {ma preti co rairselnei be do}
What would CowboyNeal Do? -- No idea. Something with {la kauboinil. mo}, I
suppose? I don't know how to express "what would he do [if here were in this
situation]" at all.

